  "name": "Mythic+: enemies left when a run ends refuse to fight (#11452)",
  "contract": [
    "#11452: when a Mythic+ run ended, the enemies still alive kept fighting the group. As on retail they now refuse",
    "to fight once the run is complete, timed or not: they drop combat, stop moving and casting, take no damage and",
    "do not attack back, so they behave like training dummies. The scenario plays the Scarlet Monastery Armory key of",
    "mythic-plus-overtime-no-cache-7720 to its end (out of time, which completes the run all the same) with one",
    "Scarlet Myrmidon summoned during the run and still fighting the hero when Herod dies."
  ],
